Done. Two files changed:

**`rust/src/lib.rs`** — added:
```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note>
```
Filters notes whose `tags` contain an exact match for `tag` (not substring), preserving relative order.

**`rust/src/main.rs`** — the `list` command now accepts `--tag <TAG>`:
```
notekeep list --tag rust
```
When the flag is present, output is filtered through `filter_by_tag`; without it, all notes print as before.

Verified: `cargo check` and `cargo test` both pass (2 existing tests).


